1. Refactored the TypeScript ecosystem plugins for pi_agent_rust. Partially completed — now supports plugin integration, but there are still many limitations in the sandbox. 2. Integrated long/short-term memory and summarization/reflection plugins based on Hermes for the pi agent. The memory components are already integrated, and reflection and summarization are also done, but the results are not good enough yet. Further optimization is planned for next week. 3. Refactored the KV cache for the large model, mainly to improve quick response in conversations and to speed up reflection and summarization. There are still many issues; will continue optimization next week.
